{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/f92d47bcf13c3a84bd0568bd1c0f1c61.poster.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/f92d47bcf13c3a84bd0568bd1c0f1c61.webm?t=1768976286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basketboy\u2019s Adventure</strong> is a semi\u2013open-world adventure and RPG where you play as a traveler from the legendary <i>Clan of Kun</i>. In this lighthearted and chaotic urban tale, you\u2019ll gather adorable pet companions, solve the problems plaguing Gugu City, and take down mischievous foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grab your basketball and break the meme dimension!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When socially anxious reapers and mutated city monsters gnaw away at Gugu City\u2019s peace, the weakened <i>Chicken God</i> sends a signal of salvation across parallel worlds \u2014 and only the descendants of the black-suited, suspender-wearing <i>Clan of Kun</i> can restore order through the power of basketball and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/14cc8300cbabe320b3f091be5a42dd6b.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1560 height=683 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Basketboy\u2019s Adventure</i> brings the entire meme culture <i>into the game</i>. You\u2019re not just looking at memes anymore\u2026 you\u2019re playing them! Every detail is a love letter to internet humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts off with a bang \u2014 the main character Kun\u2019s black shirt and suspenders are recreated in full glory. Holding a basketball like it\u2019s a nuke button, his basic attack syncs perfectly to the iconic meme rhythm, while his signature move <i>Iron Mountain Lean</i> features the legendary meme pose itself. This is meme-play taken to a whole new level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/e2908e4d2866d42b39f7ab402cb6321b.poster.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/e2908e4d2866d42b39f7ab402cb6321b.webm?t=1768976286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another save-the-world journey \u2014 it\u2019s a joyful, Cute-style RPG adventure filled with humor and chill vibes.<br>Now it\u2019s your turn to grab the basketball and begin your legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Casual combat, strategic builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into the legendary <i>Kun\u00a0</i>and experience a combat system that\u2019s easy to pick up yet packed with strategy. Battles combine manual skill use with automatic pet attacks. You can take full control in top-down combat, chaining flashy combos and unlocking new transformation abilities as your journey progresses \u2014 or sit back and let your trusty companions do the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/8ac6defb3691384b0db3a7fb915fa300.poster.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/8ac6defb3691384b0db3a7fb915fa300.webm?t=1768976286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond battle, you can form a team of up to four different pets, each with unique roles. Equip both your character and pets with gear and food buffs to create your own one-of-a-kind dream squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprising collection, adorable companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Gugu City, many cute pets await discovery. They\u2019re not only your allies in combat but also loyal friends on your journey. Each has unique skills and growth paths, allowing for creative and unexpected synergies. Even better \u2014 you can <i>transform into them</i>, experiencing their distinct abilities firsthand and expanding your tactical options even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/44e3e21ec6116f7e629480f75c06c506.avif?t=1768976286\" width=960 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn cartoon world \u2014 a secret adventure in Basket City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole of Gugu City is your playground! From the majestic statue plaza to neon-lit internet caf\u00e9s, billiard halls, cozy convenience stores, milk tea shops, and flower stands \u2014 every corner has been crafted with care. There are no strict objectives here; explore freely at your own pace. Each everyday building might hide surprises \u2014 treasure chests tucked in corners, spontaneous side stories, or maybe a charming lady NPC. Every step of exploration feels like unboxing a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/a9dd1f6df7cc85ff056feca331e47ffe.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of lively characters \u2014 thanks to Live2D technology, the residents of Gugu City come to life with expressive animations and personality. You\u2019ll meet all kinds of unique individuals \u2014 from graceful heroines to quirky monsters \u2014 each with their own charm and story to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/7aaccb1129a1e67cf3cbc72ce70c05dd.poster.avif?t=1768976286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/7aaccb1129a1e67cf3cbc72ce70c05dd.webm?t=1768976286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to begin this heartwarming and hilarious adventure?<br><i>Basketboy\u2019s Adventure</i> awaits you in the vibrant world of Gugu City!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Debut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/4e88c9a235efb435c5d586b93eb07b2055ad00d3.jpg"},{"name":"Burger King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/94f6ef80d9443d82206a3518d1a704435a1782bc.jpg"},{"name":"Extra Large Fries","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/9edc45da29e309f4d164f836410bfbd41f1d912c.jpg"},{"name":"Networks usually","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/c754deffc7b07e0e09c3c7a2fed3e30fa61f1fee.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/a515aaf8c56d2c736d24a46923266f59d052a938.jpg"},{"name":"What kind of bird is this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/51123f5500e522dd1cb56c58ffefb1a97e8e0b04.jpg"},{"name":"Takoyaki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478660/328da6d7c8bd3383e6a10dcc6e6744bc36ee5c3b.jpg"},{"name"